# CLIENT PII PROTECTION:
# Every per-site business dossier is named README.md (emails, phones, owner
# names, addresses live ONLY there). This blanket rule blocks every untracked
# README.md anywhere — i.e., all site dossiers. The ROOT README.md of this repo
# is already tracked, and gitignore never untracks tracked files, so it stays
# on GitHub and keeps updating normally. Site folders themselves (audit files,
# PDFs, Outreach, Screenshots, data/) ARE pushed as progress backup.
README.md
